# UX flow A: a beat on T1 from a fresh boot, every sound visible at once (12 presses)
wait 300
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
tap PLAY
wait 400
tapkey b1
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
tapkey b2
tapkey w2
tapkey w6
tapkey w10
tapkey w14
wait 300
shot a06_hats.png
expect note 1 1 1 1
expect note 1 1 5 1
expect note 1 1 3 3
# hold SEQ and play a black key: the sound shown is the one it plays
press SEQ
tapkey b0
release SEQ
expect page Steps
wait 60
shot a07_kick_shown.png
tap PLAY
